@startsalt wf-app-sca
' Low-fi wireframes — SCR-APP-SCA, the bank app's SCA screen, fed by RM-SCA-PROMPT.
' PROPOSAL, AI. SRC-ADR: the CIAM asks the app to present this screen on the enrolled device,
' where the PSU confirms his identity with the final authentication method.
' The payment variant is drawn with the amount and payee ONLY as one candidate answer to Q-46 —
' SRC-ADR names no surface for them, and the bank has not chosen one.
title SCR-APP-SCA — bank app SCA screen, low-fi wireframes (proposal)
{
  {+
    {* <b>Confirm it's you</b> }
    ..
    "You allowed <b>Sandbox AISP Ltd</b>"
    "to see 1 account until 1 Nov 2017"
    "on ⟨date, time⟩"
    ..
    "[ Face / fingerprint / PIN ]"
    ..
    { [ Not me — reject ] | [ Confirm ] }
  } | . | {+
    {* <b>Confirm it's you</b> — payment variant, Q-46 }
    ..
    "Pay <b>123.50 EUR</b>"
    "to Merchant123"
    "DE02 1001 0010 9307 1186 03"
    "requested by Sandbox PISP Ltd"
    ..
    "[ Face / fingerprint / PIN ]"
    ..
    { [ Not me — reject ] | [ Confirm ] }
  }
}
@endsalt
